            "**Promotion:** advertising, branding, jingles, hoardings, mass and folk media, celebrity endorsement, point-of-sale display, public relations and interpersonal persuasion - the visible part, and the part on which programmes wrongly spend most of their attention.",
            "**Added Ps:** **People** (staff, retailers and frontline workers - selection, training, incentive and supervision), **Partnership** (other departments, NGOs, professional bodies, industry, media), **Policy** (law and regulation that sustain the change - COTPA, the salt iodisation notification), and **Purse strings** (funding source, size and duration).",
